<title>ROMANIA: MINOR TREMOR ROCKS ROMANIA, NO DAMAGE REPORTED.</title>
<headline>MINOR TREMOR ROCKS ROMANIA, NO DAMAGE REPORTED.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A minor quake measuring 3.6 degrees on the open-ended Richter scale shook southern Romania on Monday, but no damage or casualties were reported, the Earth Physics Institute said.</p>
<p>The tremor, with the epicentre in the southern Horezu area, occurred at 1038 local (0838 gmt), it said.</p>
